    <description type="markdown">EE542 Lab 8 Part 7: two bare-metal d7525 nodes (A30 + ConnectX-6) on one LAN.

node0 = 10.10.1.1, node1 = 10.10.1.2 (/24), Ubuntu 24.04 (UBUNTU24-64-STD).
Each node gets a local /mydata file system for Docker's data-root, because the
root disk is 64 GB and the DOCA image is about 22 GB.</description>
    <instructions type="markdown">Start on the Wisconsin cluster in the DOCA-GPU project, inside the team's
reserved slot. Log in with ssh to node0 and node1 from the List View.
</instructions>
